# Admin web

- Verify UI changes with `npm run dev:mock` (fixtures, no AWS). A behavior change is exercised in the browser, not judged from one screenshot. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- The admin console uses Bootstrap 5. Do not add Tailwind. Use TanStack Query for server data. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- The API client sends the Cognito ID token as the bearer token. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Tokens live in sessionStorage. Closing the tab ends the session. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Cover a changed page with a unit test, and with the Playwright smoke when navigation changes. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
